Subject: [PATCH 1/5] 14.10+17.10.20170619-0ubuntu6+unity1
 (docs/package-patches-b/debdiff/hud_+unity1.debdiff)

---
 CMakeLists.txt                    |  4 ++--
 cmake/GtkDocScanGObjWrapper.cmake |  2 +-
 cmake/UseConstantBuilder.cmake    |  2 +-
